{"articleNo":"232574","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=232574&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 2019년 교원 및 직원 대상 만족도 조사 실시 및 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.12.18","hit":"4564","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(2019년 교원 및 직원 대상 만족도 조사 실시 및 참여 안내)</strong></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\">우리 대학에서는 본교 교원 및 직원을 대상으로 만족도 조사를 실시하고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\">본 조사는 우리대학 교직원들의 종합만족도 진단과 의견수렴 등을 통해 </span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\">양질의 교육&nbsp;서비스 제공을 위한 정책개발 자료로 활용하고자 실시하는 조사입니다.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\">귀하께서 응답하신 사항은 우리 대학 교육정책수립의 소중한 자료로 활용될 것이며,</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\">통계작성의 목적으로만 이용될 것이므로, 바쁘신 중에라도 잠시 시간을 내시어 성의껏 응답해 주시길 부탁드립니다.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 90%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-f